WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.295
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with

00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:06.387
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.909
Choose one clear message about a community need.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.675
Draw a bold image that supports the message.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.358
Add a few large readable words and check the layout. Explain one respectful

00:00:20.358 --> 00:00:23.136
similarity or difference with another African example.
